# Chapter IV, the Baron's hideout: Jarko leads the player to the abandoned
# Grivenhard house, its hidden cellar holds the Baron's henchmen and a note
# naming his camp in the Old Forest, where the Baron dies.
# Position stands in for the walks, and damage for the sword fights; ref
# FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from baron_house
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Jarko leads the player from the guild, out through its secret door and
# across the city to the abandoned house by the harbor; he walks, so the
# player does too. He stays outside as lookout. His own companion script
# warps him up behind a moving player, so only the yard legs wait for him.
case baron_house
defend
walk -22 1825 328
walk -41 -57 724
bye if open
walk -41 -57 724
until 3000 "DIEBJarkoderGaukler"->GetDistance player < 400
activate 05E9C307
until 300 GetPCCell "Stormwend, Thieves Guild" == 0
# Off the door's landing before waiting: Jarko comes out of the door onto it and shoves a player
# still standing there into the yard wall.
walk -5771 41306 224
bye if open
until 3000 "DIEBJarkoderGaukler"->GetDistance player < 600
# At the harbor gate the guard may greet the player; the pole swings up
# once the player is within 400, and only while no menu is open.
walk 20 53150 224
bye if open
walk 20 53150 224
wait 60
bye if open
until 900 "einlass_gate_pole".State == 30
walk 6480 59100 160
bye if open
walk 6480 59100 160
bye if open
walk 6480 59100 160
bye if open
until 3000 "DIEBJarkoderGaukler"->GetDistance player < 600
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_IV_VersteckdesBarons == 1
until 600 "DIEBJarkoderGaukler"->GetCurrentAIPackage != 3
bye if open
expect "DIEBJarkoderGaukler"->GetDistance player < 1000
activate 05EB5A42
until 300 GetPCCell "Stormwend, Abandoned House" == 1
end

# Inside, the player looks around.
case baron_inside
run
player->PositionCell -236 -420 137 0 "Stormwend, Abandoned House"
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_IV_VersteckdesBarons == 2
end

# A letter on the upper floor; picking it up moves something below.
case baron_letter
run
player->PositionCell -341 -440 705 0 "Stormwend, Abandoned House"
activate 053B54E0
take 053B54E0
close Book Menu
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_IV_VersteckdesBarons == 3
expect "VerlassenesHausSchrank"->GetDisabled == 1
end

# A henchman of the Baron waits in the cellar, and attacks.
case baron_henchman
run
player->PositionCell -1984 -1060 -509 0 "Stormwend, Abandoned House"
talk BaronScherge01
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_VersteckdesBarons == 4
console 05C2F7CF.damageav health 10000
console 05CD6FE4.damageav health 10000
console 053705D9.damageav health 10000
until 300 "BaronScherge01"->GetHealth <= 0
end

# The Baron's message names his hideout.
case baron_message
run
player->PositionCell -3527 1040 -680 0 "Stormwend, Abandoned House"
activate 059DEEF5
take 059DEEF5
close Book Menu
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_IV_VersteckdesBarons == 5
end

# The Old Forest hideout: the Baron and the Masterthief. Outside the house
# Jarko, the lookout, asks what the player learned; there is no time, and he
# describes the way.
case baron_hideout
run
player->Position 6480 59100 160 0
until 600 MenuMode == 1
choose 99
bye if open
run
player->Position 76700 -28500 2531 0
until 300 "DerBaron01"->GetDisabled == 0
until 600 "DerBaron01".State == 1
console 054831D6.damageav health 10000
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_IV_VersteckdesBarons == 6
expect Diebesgildevar == 20
expect Stormwendvar == 19
end
